@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

@donorId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001


### 0. A API está no ar?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### A1. Quais lotes estão disponíveis?
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches


### A2. Quais instituições existem (todas validadas pelo administrador)?
GET {{baseUrl}}/institutions


### A3. O diferencial do TCC: as duas estratégias nos mesmos dados
GET {{baseUrl}}/comparison?now=2026-10-16T12:00:00Z


### B1. Cadastrar ONG perto, sem geladeira (nasce NÃO validada: RN03)
# @name instNear
POST {{baseUrl}}/institutions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ONG Perto (sem geladeira)",
  "latitude": -3.110,
  "longitude": -60.0217,
  "hasRefrigeration": false,
  "availableCapacityKg": 100
}


### B2. Cadastrar ONG longe, com geladeira
# @name instFar
POST {{baseUrl}}/institutions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ONG Longe (com geladeira)",
  "latitude": -3.083,
  "longitude": -60.0217,
  "hasRefrigeration": true,
  "availableCapacityKg": 100,
  "acceptedFoodTypes": ["HORTIFRUTI", "LATICINIOS"]
}


### B3. O doador cadastra o lote (validade: daqui a 2 horas)
# @name batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": "{{donorId}}",
  "foodType": "HORTIFRUTI",
  "quantityKg": 18,
  "expiresAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 2 h}}",
  "storageCondition": "REFRIGERATED",
  "latitude": -3.119,
  "longitude": -60.0217
}


### B4. Matching ANTES de o administrador validar as instituições
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches/{{batch.response.body.$.batch.id}}/matches


### B5. Administrador valida a ONG Perto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{instNear.response.body.$.institution.id}}/validate


### B6. Administrador valida a ONG Longe
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{instFar.response.body.$.institution.id}}/validate


### B7. Estratégia SOMENTE DISTÂNCIA (como os apps parecidos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches/{{batch.response.body.$.batch.id}}/matches?strategy=distance


### B8. Estratégia MULTICRITÉRIO (o diferencial do Elo Alimentar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches/{{batch.response.body.$.batch.id}}/matches?strategy=multicriteria


### C1. Lote com validade no passado -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": "{{donorId}}",
  "foodType": "HORTIFRUTI",
  "quantityKg": 10,
  "expiresAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "storageCondition": "REFRIGERATED",
  "latitude": -3.119,
  "longitude": -60.0217
}


### C2. Tipo de alimento inexistente -> 400 (validação)
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorId": "{{donorId}}",
  "foodType": "PIZZA",
  "quantityKg": 10,
  "expiresAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 2 h}}",
  "storageCondition": "DRY",
  "latitude": -3.119,
  "longitude": -60.0217
}


### C3. Lote que não existe -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches/nao-existe
